Now we'll build the login API.

Authentication Flow
React Login Page
       │
       ▼
POST /auth/login
       │
       ▼
Find User by Email
       │
       ▼
Compare Password (bcrypt)
       │
       ▼
Generate JWT
       │
       ▼
Return Token
       │
       ▼
React stores token

